# Module 02: React Fundamentals & Component Architecture

## Why React?

As web applications grow, managing user interfaces using traditional DOM manipulation becomes increasingly difficult.

React solves this challenge by introducing a component-based architecture that enables developers to build scalable, reusable, and maintainable user interfaces.

Today React powers applications developed by startups, enterprises, and technology companies worldwide.

---

## Learning Outcomes

After completing this module, students will be able to:

* Understand React's purpose
* Explain Component-Based Architecture
* Write JSX
* Create Functional Components
* Use Props
* Build reusable UI elements
* Understand the Virtual DOM concept

